<title>HONG KONG: Le Saunda year net rises 62.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Le Saunda year net rises 62.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.4   vs  7.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.5    vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    50.82  vs  31.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		     648.11 vs  694.94</p>
<p>    Company name		 Le Saunda Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 17-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Le Saunda is a shoe retailer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 8.5 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of three cents) vs 4.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
